**GM** — *as Falrinth, warning about the scarab*
> "He looks at it funny and goes, Yes, you should be more, far more careful with it than you have been. Lucius will know it on sight. Senshock will know it on sight. They will use it against you in different ways, and neither will tell you they notice. That is the sort of thing I see, and they have not. Yet."

**Sequoia** — *acknowledging*
